00:22:41.261 --> 00:22:46.140
is not there, I will make sure to send out
the link to the documentation for them after

00:22:46.140 --> 00:22:47.789
the presentation.

00:22:47.789 --> 00:22:52.710
And the contigs are available in both Amazon
and GCP.

00:22:52.710 --> 00:22:58.690
[Peter] The other question is about the compute
